      "title": "做兩次",
      "prompt": "$\\int x^2 e^x\\,dx$",
      "problemId": "int-052",
      "steps": [
        "第一次：$u=x^2$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$。得 $x^2 e^x-\\int 2x e^x\\,dx$。",
        "第二次處理 $\\int 2x e^x\\,dx$：$u=2x$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$。得 $2x e^x-\\int 2e^x\\,dx=2x e^x-2e^x$。",
        "合起來：$x^2 e^x-(2x e^x-2e^x)=e^x(x^2-2x+2)+C$。注意括號前的減號要分配進去。"
      ],
      "answer": "$e^x(x^2-2x+2)+C$",
      "claim": "D(e^x*(x^2-2*x+2)) == x^2*e^x"
    },
    {
      "title": "表格法",
