      "answer": "$e^{2x}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)+C$",
      "claim": "D(e^(2*x)*(x^2/2-x/2+1/4)) == x^2*e^(2*x)"
    },
    {
      "title": "定積分",
      "prompt": "$\\int_0^1 (x+1) e^x\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "$u=x+1$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$：$(x+1)e^x-\\int e^x\\,dx=(x+1)e^x-e^x=x e^x$。",
        "代上下限：$[x e^x]_0^1=e-0=e$。",
        "回頭看：$(x e^x)'=e^x+x e^x=(x+1)e^x$，被積函數本來就是一個乘積的導數。"
      ],
      "answer": "$e$",
      "claim": "INT((x+1)*e^x,0,1) == e ;; D(x*e^x) == (x+1)*e^x"
